   "title": "CHARACTER LOCK \u2014 who Ake is",
   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "Redraw the character in image 1 keeping his identity exactly: a plump goldfish inside a spherical glass fishbowl mounted on a small wheeled wooden dolly, with huge googly eyes, a drooping walrus moustache and prominent front teeth, wearing a small dark cap lettered FEW perched on top of the bowl. Keep the glass bowl, the wheeled dolly, the googly eyes, the walrus moustache, the buck teeth and the FEW cap identical to image 1. Keep every colour as muted and desaturated as image 1. The new drawing shows him as follows:"
   ],
